"{\"eval_set_result_id\":\"first_agent_evalset351450_1767729397.449448\",\"eval_set_result_name\":\"first_agent_evalset351450_1767729397.449448\",\"eval_set_id\":\"evalset351450\",\"eval_case_results\":[{\"eval_set_file\":\"evalset351450\",\"eval_set_id\":\"evalset351450\",\"eval_id\":\"casee31e46\",\"final_eval_status\":2,\"eval_metric_results\":null,\"overall_eval_metric_results\":[{\"metric_name\":\"tool_trajectory_avg_score\",\"threshold\":1.0,\"judge_model_options\":null,\"criterion\":null,\"score\":1.0,\"eval_status\":1,\"details\":{\"rubric_scores\":null}},{\"metric_name\":\"response_match_score\",\"threshold\":0.7,\"judge_model_options\":null,\"criterion\":null,\"score\":0.492040520984081,\"eval_status\":2,\"details\":{\"rubric_scores\":null}}],\"eval_metric_result_per_invocation\":[{\"actual_invocation\":{\"invocation_id\":\"e-1cf79217-e3b8-4f6e-8f11-00ed9ec8809c\",\"user_content\":{\"parts\":[{\"media_resolution\":null,\"code_execution_result\":null,\"executable_code\":null,\"file_data\":null,\"function_call\":null,\"function_response\":null,\"inline_data\":null,\"text\":\"What is Agent Development Kit from Google? What languages is the SDK available in?\",\"thought\":null,\"thought_signature\":null,\"video_metadata\":null}],\"role\":\"user\"},\"final_response\":{\"parts\":[{\"media_resolution\":null,\"code_execution_result\":null,\"executable_code\":null,\"file_data\":null,\"function_call\":null,\"function_response\":null,\"inline_data\":null,\"text\":\"The Agent Development Kit (ADK) from Google is a set of tools and libraries designed to help developers create and integrate intelligent agents into various applications and services.\\n\\nWhile there isn't one single, universally-named \\\"Google Agent Development Kit\\\" that applies to all types of agents, Google offers several related SDKs and frameworks that serve this purpose, primarily centered around **conversational AI** and **machine learning**:\\n\\n1.  **Dialogflow ES/CX SDKs:**\\n    *   **Purpose:** These are the primary tools for building conversational interfaces (chatbots, voice assistants) powered by Google's AI. They allow you to define intents, entities, fulfillment logic, and integrate with messaging platforms.\\n    *   **Languages:** The client libraries (SDKs) for interacting with Dialogflow APIs are typically available in popular programming languages, including:\\n        *   **Python**\\n        *   **Node.js (JavaScript)**\\n        *   **Java**\\n        *   **Go**\\n        *   **.NET (C#)**\\n        *   **PHP**\\n        *   **Ruby**\\n        *   And often through REST APIs, making it accessible from virtually any language that can make HTTP requests.\\n\\n2.  **Vertex AI SDKs (for generative AI/LLM-based agents):**\\n    *   **Purpose:** As Google focuses heavily on generative AI and large language models (LLMs), Vertex AI provides the platform and SDKs for building more advanced AI agents. This includes tools for prompting LLMs, fine-tuning models, and orchestrating complex AI workflows.\\n    *   **Languages:** The Vertex AI SDKs are robust and available in:\\n        *   **Python** (very strong support, including for Google's GenAI Studio and Colab notebooks)\\n        *   **Node.js (JavaScript)**\\n        *   **Java**\\n        *   **Go**\\n        *   **.NET (C#)**\\n        *   And again, comprehensive REST APIs.\\n\\n3.  **Google Cloud Client Libraries (General Purpose):**\\n    *   **Purpose:** While not specific to \\\"agents,\\\" these libraries provide access to underlying services like Natural Language AI, Speech-to-Text, Text-to-Speech, Vision AI, etc., which are foundational components for building any sophisticated agent.\\n    *   **Languages:** These are available across a very wide range of languages, including all those listed for Dialogflow and Vertex AI, and often more.\\n\\n**In summary:**\\n\\nThe \\\"Agent Development Kit\\\" from Google typically refers to a combination of their conversational AI platforms (like Dialogflow) and their broader machine learning/generative AI platform (Vertex AI), along with their underlying AI service APIs.\\n\\nThe SDKs for these platforms are widely available in leading programming languages such as **Python, Node.js (JavaScript), Java, Go, .NET (C#), PHP, and Ruby**, making them accessible to a broad developer community.\",\"thought\":null,\"thought_signature\":null,\"video_metadata\":null}],\"role\":\"model\"},\"intermediate_data\":{\"invocation_events\":[]},\"creation_timestamp\":1767729394.150724,\"rubrics\":null,\"app_details\":{\"agent_details\":{\"root_agent\":{\"name\":\"root_agent\",\"instructions\":\"Answer user questions to the best of your knowledge\\n\\nYou are an agent. Your internal name is \\\"root_agent\\\". The description about you is \\\"A helpful assistant for user questions.\\\".\",\"tool_declarations\":[]}}}},\"expected_invocation\":{\"invocation_id\":\"e-c9729295-5b9c-4251-934b-cdda8de2b03e\",\"user_content\":{\"parts\":[{\"media_resolution\":null,\"code_execution_result\":null,\"executable_code\":null,\"file_data\":null,\"function_call\":null,\"function_response\":null,\"inline_data\":null,\"text\":\"What is Agent Development Kit from Google? What languages is the SDK available in?\",\"thought\":null,\"thought_signature\":null,\"video_metadata\":null}],\"role\":\"user\"},\"final_response\":{\"parts\":[{\"media_resolution\":null,\"code_execution_result\":null,\"executable_code\":null,\"file_data\":null,\"function_call\":null,\"function_response\":null,\"inline_data\":null,\"text\":\"While Google does not market a specific product called \\\"Agent Development Kit\\\" under that exact name, the platform that most closely fits the description of an \\\"Agent Development Kit\\\" for building conversational AI agents from Google is **Dialogflow**.\\n\\n**What is Dialogflow?**\\n\\nDialogflow is Google's development suite for building conversational interfaces for various applications and platforms. It allows developers to create natural language understanding (NLU) experiences to build virtual agents (often called chatbots, voice bots, or conversational agents) that can understand, process, and respond to user input in natural language.\\n\\nKey features and capabilities include:\\n\\n*   **Natural Language Understanding (NLU):** Converts user's natural language input into structured data.\\n*   **Intent Recognition:** Identifies the user's goal or intention from their input.\\n*   **Entity Extraction:** Pulls out specific pieces of information (entities) from the user's input.\\n*   **Context Management:** Maintains the context of a conversation for more natural and continuous interactions.\\n*   **Integration:** Can be integrated with various platforms like Google Assistant, Slack, Facebook Messenger, websites, mobile apps, and more.\\n*   **Different Editions:** Dialogflow offers two main editions:\\n    *   **Dialogflow ES (Essentials):** The standard, widely used edition suitable for many applications.\\n    *   **Dialogflow CX (Customer Experience):** A more advanced and complex version designed for large-scale enterprise conversations, offering more visual flow control and state management.\\n\\nEssentially, Dialogflow provides the tools and infrastructure to design, build, and deploy intelligent agents that can engage in human-like conversations.\\n\\n**What languages are the SDKs available in?**\\n\\nDialogflow provides client libraries (SDKs) and APIs to interact with its services, allowing developers to integrate their applications with Dialogflow agents. The primary languages for the official client libraries for Dialogflow (both ES and CX) typically include:\\n\\n*   **Python**\\n*   **Node.js**\\n*   **Java**\\n*   **C#**\\n*   **Go**\\n*   **PHP**\\n*   **Ruby**\\n\\nAdditionally, since Dialogflow also provides **REST and gRPC APIs**, you can interact with it using virtually any programming language that can make HTTP requests or use gRPC clients, even if an official client library isn't available for that specific language.\",\"thought\":null,\"thought_signature\":null,\"video_metadata\":null}],\"role\":\"model\"},\"intermediate_data\":{\"tool_uses\":[],\"tool_responses\":[],\"intermediate_responses\":[]},\"creation_timestamp\":1767727397.300311,\"rubrics\":null,\"app_details\":null},\"eval_metric_results\":[{\"metric_name\":\"tool_trajectory_avg_score\",\"threshold\":1.0,\"judge_model_options\":null,\"criterion\":null,\"score\":1.0,\"eval_status\":1,\"details\":{\"rubric_scores\":null}},{\"metric_name\":\"response_match_score\",\"threshold\":0.7,\"judge_model_options\":null,\"criterion\":null,\"score\":0.492040520984081,\"eval_status\":2,\"details\":{\"rubric_scores\":null}}]}],\"session_id\":\"___eval___session___877550d3-e07d-49c7-aea1-2952523db6c9\",\"session_details\":{\"id\":\"___eval___session___877550d3-e07d-49c7-aea1-2952523db6c9\",\"app_name\":\"first_agent\",\"user_id\":\"user\",\"state\":{\"__llm_request_key__\":\"90650892-50a5-4d09-95d3-18e6ea1b0564\"},\"events\":[{\"model_version\":null,\"content\":{\"parts\":[{\"media_resolution\":null,\"code_execution_result\":null,\"executable_code\":null,\"file_data\":null,\"function_call\":null,\"function_response\":null,\"inline_data\":null,\"text\":\"What is Agent Development Kit from Google? What languages is the SDK available in?\",\"thought\":null,\"thought_signature\":null,\"video_metadata\":null}],\"role\":\"user\"},\"grounding_metadata\":null,\"partial\":null,\"turn_complete\":null,\"finish_reason\":null,\"error_code\":null,\"error_message\":null,\"interrupted\":null,\"custom_metadata\":null,\"usage_metadata\":null,\"live_session_resumption_update\":null,\"input_transcription\":null,\"output_transcription\":null,\"avg_logprobs\":null,\"logprobs_result\":null,\"cache_metadata\":null,\"citation_metadata\":null,\"interaction_id\":null,\"invocation_id\":\"e-1cf79217-e3b8-4f6e-8f11-00ed9ec8809c\",\"author\":\"user\",\"actions\":{\"skip_summarization\":null,\"state_delt